      "s.ph.area":"e.g. neighborhood or area","s.ph.optional":"Optional","s.ph.subject":"e.g. French, Math, English...","s.ph.when":"Optional — e.g. within two weeks","s.ph.notes":"Optional — any detail that helps us match better.",
      "s.ok.title":"Your request has been received.","s.ok.body":"We'll review your need and contact you by phone or WhatsApp shortly to propose suitable candidates.",
      "s.problem.title":"Finding the right teacher… a real challenge","s.problem.p1":"In many private institutions, finding teachers still relies on referrals, personal networks, WhatsApp and Facebook groups, or piles of CVs.","s.problem.p2":"It gets harder for a sensitive subject like French or Math, languages and science subjects, or when an urgent replacement is needed.",
      "s.pain1":"Hard to find a suitable teacher quickly","s.pain2":"Time wasted sorting CVs","s.pain3":"Risk of a poor hire, especially in French and Math",
      "s.solution.title":"Linkify organizes the teacher search","s.solution.sub":"We don't send you dozens of random profiles — but a short list of candidates closest to your need.",
      "s.crit1":"Subject or specialty","s.crit2":"Level","s.crit3":"City and proximity","s.crit4":"Years of experience","s.crit5":"Work type","s.crit6":"Current availability","s.crit7":"CV","s.crit8":"Urgent-cover readiness",
      "s.how.title":"How does it work?","s.how.sub":"A simple process, no complexity.","s.step1t":"Tell us your need","s.step1b":"Subject, level, city and work type — via a short form.","s.step2t":"We review candidates","s.step2b":"We analyze available profiles against your criteria.","s.step3t":"We propose a shortlist","s.step3b":"3 to 5 teachers suited to your need.","s.step4t":"You contact directly","s.step4b":"The profiles that fit your institution.","s.step5t":"We follow up","s.step5b":"To improve the quality of future recommendations.",
      "s.cases.title":"When does your institution need Linkify?","s.case1":"Start of the school year","s.case2":"Sudden teacher departure","s.case3":"Temporary absence (illness / leave)","s.case4":"Need a substitute quickly","s.case5":"Opening a new level or group","s.case6":"A hard-to-fill subject","s.case7":"Support, languages or training teachers",
      "s.subj.title":"Current priority specialties","s.subj.sub":"We focus first on the specialties most in demand in private education.","s.chip.fr":"French","s.chip.math":"Mathematics","s.chip.en":"English","s.chip.pc":"Physics & Chemistry","s.chip.svt":"Life & Earth Sciences","s.chip.primary":"Primary teachers","s.chip.support":"Support & language staff",
      "s.why.title":"Why Linkify?","s.why.p":"Referrals and networks remain important, but they aren't always enough — especially for urgent needs or hard-to-fill subjects. Linkify adds an organizational layer that complements your current methods:","s.wl1":"Less time wasted sorting CVs","s.wl2":"Candidates by clear criteria","s.wl3":"Know availability, city and experience before calling","s.wl4":"Avoid contacting unsuitable profiles","s.wl5":"A faster, better-organized set of choices",
      "s.faq.title":"Frequently asked questions","s.faq.q1":"Is Linkify.ma a recruitment agency?","s.faq.a1":"No. Linkify.ma is a digital service that helps organize the connection between private institutions and candidate teachers. The final hiring decision always rests with the institution.","s.faq.q2":"Are teachers employed by Linkify?","s.faq.a2":"No. We help propose suitable candidates; the institution contacts them and decides on its own criteria.","s.faq.q3":"Do you guarantee teacher quality?","s.faq.a3":"We do an initial screening based on available information. But the interview, classroom trial and final decision are the institution's responsibility.","s.faq.q4":"Is the service free?","s.faq.a4":"During the pilot phase, institutions can request an initial trial. A clear model will be defined later.","s.faq.q5":"Can I request a teacher urgently?","s.faq.a5":"Yes, you can mark the need as urgent, and we'll try to propose suitable candidates based on availability.","s.faq.q6":"Which subjects do you focus on?","s.faq.a6":"First French, Math, languages and science subjects, with other specialties added gradually.",
      "s.trust.title":"Your professional data is safe","s.trust.p1":"The information you share is used only to understand your need and propose suitable candidates. We don't publish your requests, and we don't share your institution's data with any unrelated party without your consent.","s.trust.p2":"Linkify.ma is a private Moroccan project in a pilot phase with a limited number of private institutions. The final decision to invite, interview or hire always rests with the institution.",
